$356
God is described as the creator of the heavens, the earth, land, seas, plants, animals and humans, and as the one who rested on the seventh day after completing His work【chunk-16】. He also commanded creation to increase, multiply and fill the waters and the earth【chunk-9】, and gave names to the dry land (Earth) and the waters (Seas)【chunk-4】.
