cache:query:what is a man?
$346
A man is a being that God created “to his own image” and “to the likeness of God,” male and female, endowed with a spiritual soul that carries understanding and free will. The divine image is not in the body but in that soul, and the plural language used by God points to the plurality of persons in the Deity【chunk-12】【chunk-55】.
